OL,3,GNEWSAFire service logs nearly 130
OL,4,Aaccidents in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tripping while responding
OL,7,Fto moorland blazes and being hit by
OL,8,Ffalling equipment are among the
OL,9,Fworkplace accidents recorded by West
OL,10,FYorkshire Fire & Rescue Service
OL,11,F(WYFRS).
OL,13,FThese incidents cost the service more
OL,14,Fthan #160,000 in the year from April
OL,15,F2025 to March 2026, according to a
OL,16,Freport discussed by West Yorkshire Fire
OL,17,FAuthority on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
