OL,3,GNEWSAFire service logs nearly 130
OL,4,Aaccidents in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt revealed there were 128 accidents in
OL,7,Fthe period, a 6% rise compared to the
OL,8,Fprevious year. But the figure was a
OL,9,Fstark contrast to the 300 recorded in
OL,10,F2005/06.
OL,12,FMark Dixon, head of occupational health
OL,13,Fat the service, hailed the longer-term
OL,14,Fimprovement, adding: "There are good
OL,15,Fnews stories in this report."
